      <activity id="fa6095df-7717-572d-84ec-66f55f664a56" activityNameId="cffa37a4-8434-56c6-b8a2-b5d4ae1887fa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door, inner, functional, wood, steel frame, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door, inner, functional, wood, steel frame, at plant
The measures of the visible door leaf are 0.9m x 2m. 1m2 of visible wooden door (incl. steel frame) weighs 46.7kg. The door and frame are opaquely painted. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.\nTechnology: Industry data.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Bauteile\nLocal subcategory: Türen\nUVEK 2022 source file:634_EcoSpold_Türen_v1.5_UVEK2021_v0.2_R_corr._X-Tür_total.xml\n\n
UUID: 682a2262-71b9-30b5-91a4-7bd440dc9ae5
Included are the materials used in an inner wooden functional door and steel frame. The door leaf and frame are opaquely painted. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 door manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_682a2262-71b9-30b5-91a4-7bd440dc9ae5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
